  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/094225386a391f8b9376aff7c784333a47afc002?download\" data-file-name=\"에라토스테네스 지구크기 측정 계산(2025.04.13.배포용).xlsx\" data-file-size=\"50481\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfL3F%26dataid%3D33%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250413215138&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F094225386a391f8b9376aff7c784333a47afc002')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">에라토스테네스 지구크기 측정 계산(2025.04.13.배포용)</span><span class=\"type\">.xlsx</span></div><div class=\"size\">49.30KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4월 11일&#160; 11:27 서울 데이터 입니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 64px;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 46px;\"><td style=\"width: 15.099%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">위도</td><td style=\"width: 15.099%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">경도</td><td style=\"width: 16.5842%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">측정 일시</td><td style=\"width: 14.7277%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">막대 길이</td><td style=\"width: 16.4604%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">그림자길이</td><td style=\"width: 21.9059%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\">각도</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 15.099%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">37.656398</td><td style=\"width: 15.099%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">127.02729</td><td style=\"width: 16.5842%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2025.04.11.111:27</td><td style=\"width: 14.7277%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">22.7</td><td style=\"width: 16.4604%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">14.5</td><td style=\"width: 21.9059%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">32.5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">실제 지구크기 측정하는 방법이 담겨 있는 글</span></b><br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=fLMH&amp;datanum=2\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">매월 정기적(매월 10일쯤, 20일쯤)으로 그림자 각도를 측정하고 있습니다.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다음은 4월 20일쯤 측정이며, 측정시각은</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">-서울 포항 라인은 11시33분 전후</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">-서울 부산 라인은&#160; 12시 23분 전후</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">-서울 광주(제주) 라인은 14시 02분 전후</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">입니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">측정 날짜와 측정 시각은 </span></b><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제일 위에 있는 엑셀 파일 다운 받으시면 나와 있습니다.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">선생님께서 계시는 곳이 3개의 라인 중 어디에 가까운가는&#160;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 링크 글에 나와 있는 글을 읽어보시거나 아래 링크(구글어스-컴퓨터로 접속) 들어가시면</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">나와 있습니다.</span></b><br><b><a href=\"https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB</span></a></b></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"서울과 함께(에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정) &#8226; 수업 잘하는 교사 이강토\" data-og-description=\" \" data-og-host=\"earth.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB\" data-og-url=\"https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dvVW4E/hyYFGt6aOb/s0YkWGWM3wNSv0qgIjhKmK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bk2CN1/hyYEJerONR/VkzKM1qV0V6tyDGnM8uhmK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dAf08P/hyYCin54J5/K2xHtYKGWSYMnRpf1NVuB0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://earth.google.com/web/data=MkEKPwo9CiExMm82MlhrbE1kU2FHR3BiRWlZQlpKQlcwVkYwWDY2c2USFgoUMEE5MEEyNjczMDM2QjRFNzEyQTQgAUICCABKCAjJ_uC6BhAB\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dvVW4E/hyYFGt6aOb/s0YkWGWM3wNSv0qgIjhKmK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bk2CN1/hyYEJerONR/VkzKM1qV0V6tyDGnM8uhmK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dAf08P/hyYCin54J5/K2xHtYKGWSYMnRpf1NVuB0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">서울과 함께(에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정) &#8226; 수업 잘하는 교사 이강토</p><p class=\"og-desc\"> </p><p class=\"og-host\">earth.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;<br><b>가까운 라인이 없으시면</b><br><b>이 글에 댓글을 달아주시면</b><br><b>측정날짜와 측정시각을 협의후 같이 측정할 수 있습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>조만간 <br>중2 3단원이 진도로 나오는(?) 달, 5월이 다가옵니다.</b><br><b>3단원은 에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정 내용이 담겨 있죠.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>혹시, 학생들과 지구모형(지구본)을 가지고 실험을 하실 선생님들 중</b><br><b>실제 지구크기 측정을 아이들과 함께 해보실 선생님께서는</b><br><b>댓글 남겨주시면</b><br><b>제가 선생님께서 학생들과 함께 실제 지구 크기 측정을 할 수 있는</b><br><b>시각을 알려드리며, 제가 서울에서 측정을 동시에 해드립니다.</b><br><b>댓글 남겨주세요 ^^<br><br><br><br><br>막대는 꼭 <br>수평기(수평자)가 없어도 되어요<br>책으로 측정이 가능하요<br></b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8cacb24723fa71e6f25d2b14a1f668e26bf5ef0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8cacb24723fa71e6f25d2b14a1f668e26bf5ef0\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
